About the original game

This license covers the work of the author of this repository: the Java code
(native version at the root, emulated version in emu/), the Python tools and
the documentation.

The original game "Nibby Nibble" (c) 1993 Gabriele Roncolato was distributed
as public domain software on the cover disk of the French magazine
"Amiga Dream". The following material comes from the original game and is
kept for preservation and educational purposes, with credit to the original
author; it is not covered by the MIT License:
  - src/main/resources/assets/   graphics, levels and music extracted unmodified
  - emu/original-assets/         the original game data file, unmodified
  - emu/reverse/listings/        disassemblies of the original program
